# This repository contains the loan management app and nothing else.
#
# The working directory also holds several large reference trees that are NOT part of
# this app - HumHub installations kept for reference, the Yii API documentation, and the
# release tarballs they came from. Together they are ~2.5 GB and over 220,000 files. They
# were staged by an earlier `git add` and have never been committed; everything below
# keeps them out for good.

# ── Secrets and per-machine runtime state ────────────────────────────────────
/protected/.env
/protected/runtime/cache/*
/protected/runtime/logs/*
/protected/runtime/sessions/*
!/protected/runtime/cache/.gitkeep
!/protected/runtime/logs/.gitkeep
!/protected/runtime/sessions/.gitkeep
/protected/uploads/avatars/*
!/protected/uploads/avatars/.gitkeep

# Yii publishes assets here at runtime; regenerated on demand.
/assets/

# ── Reference copies of other software (never part of this app) ──────────────
# Every HumHub tree: the working checkout, the versioned copies and the staging copy.
/humhub/
/humhub-*/
# The Yii 2.0 API documentation downloaded for reference.
/yii-docs-*/
# The release archives those trees were extracted from, plus partial downloads.
/*.tar.gz
/*.tgz
/*.zip
/*.part

# ── Local tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Assistant/editor configuration and state, specific to this machine.
/.claude/

# ── Documentation ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All top-level docs except CODEBASE.md - working notes, audit write-ups and the
# symlinks RULES.md and HUMHUB_MAILREPLY.md, which point outside the repository and
# would be broken links for anyone cloning it. Scoped to the repo root only (leading /)
# so the vendored Yii2 framework's own bundled .md files (LICENSE.md, CHANGELOG.md,
# protected/framework/**) stay tracked - those are third-party license/changelog files,
# not this app's own docs.
/*.md
!/CODEBASE.md
